{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e02-scene-23",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "泄露的视频  (Leaked Clip Goes Viral)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "kaiwen": "凯文"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Although Kaiwen cut the outburst from the broadcast, a leaked audience clip goes viral on Weibo after diva Huimei reposts it. Let us listen to the panic in the chief editor office.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "坏了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我刚搜的辛惠美，微博上现在有一个那天的视频。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "转发都快过千了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "恐怕已经过万了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "辛惠美转发了微博，而且还点了赞。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "边边是谁？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "有一个叫边边的娱记，把辛惠美转发微博的事情写成了新闻。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "已经在路条网首页推送了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "系列行动，都是之前串通好的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "看来这事，要惊动更多人了。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "坏了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'huai.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我刚搜的辛惠美，微博上现在有一个那天的视频。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingzi uses \"sou\" to mean 'search'.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "转发都快过千了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She notes that the \"zhuanfa\", meaning 'reposts', are quickly approaching a thousand.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "恐怕已经过万了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chun Yuqiao looks at the numbers and says \"kongpa\", meaning 'I am afraid that'.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "辛惠美转发了微博，而且还点了赞。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He adds that Xin Huimei has also \"dian le zan\".'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "边边是谁？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He asks \"shei\", meaning 'who', to find out the identity of Bianbian.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "有一个叫边边的娱记，把辛惠美转发微博的事情写成了新闻。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Kaiwen explains that Bianbian is an \"yuji\", short for entertainment reporter.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "已经在路条网首页推送了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The news has already reached the \"shouye\" or 'front page.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "系列行动，都是之前串通好的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chun Yuqiao realizes this was not a spontaneous outburst.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "看来这事，要惊动更多人了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He concludes that they will \"jingdong\" or 'disturb.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "坏了！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我刚搜的辛惠美，微博上现在有一个那天的视频。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "转发都快过千了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "恐怕已经过万了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "辛惠美转发了微博，而且还点了赞。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "边边是谁？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "有一个叫边边的娱记，把辛惠美转发微博的事情写成了新闻。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "已经在路条网首页推送了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "系列行动，都是之前串通好的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "看来这事，要惊动更多人了。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "The scandal is officially out of control. You learned how to say \"huai le\" for \"oh no\", the word for \"repost\", and how to talk about giving a like on social media. See you tomorrow!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "明天见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
